% old TODO. We do not say "English version": src/tsl/strata.py queries lang="zh"
% for the density strata and src/tsl/asllex.py reads *both* zh and en to join a
% Chinese gloss to its English headword, so the edition is what we can name and
% the language version is not one thing. Both were captured 2026-08-05 (the local
% mirror's README calls it the 2026 fifth edition, which this confirms; the site
% itself is a React SPA and serves no version string through its API).
% The edition rides in `howpublished`, not in `edition`: acl_natbib.bst prints
% only author/year/title/howpublished/note for misc entries, so `edition` is
% silently dropped -- which would have left the fix for the old TODO invisible on
% the page while looking correct in the source. Checked by reading the rendered
% bibliography, not by trusting the field name. Position matches the maintainers'
