% The fine-tuning and evaluation corpus (Chinese: 臺灣手語語料庫), commissioned by
% the Ministry of Culture. Checked 2026-08-17; the old TODO is resolved as far as
% the sources allow, and what is still unresolved is said plainly here.
%
% Role, corrected. Jung-Hsing Chang (張榮興) is the project's 計畫主持人, i.e. its
% principal investigator, and the executing body is specifically NCCU's Institute
% of Linguistics (中正大學語言學研究所) -- both from PTS News 804643 (2026-04-21).
% The previous entry called him "editor-in-chief", which no source supports.
%
% Year, corrected. `2021` was a guess and is wrong. The two documents the site
% publishes are the only dated artefacts it exposes: the annotation
% specification is stamped 「114.8.24 版本」 (ROC 114 = 2025-08-24) and the
% operation manual's cover reads 2025/12/19 (PDF created 2025-12-22 by an
% itri.org.tw address, so ITRI built the site). Both are mirrored under
% /mnt/md0/corpus/sign/tslcorpus/raw/.
%
% Never write a bare at-sign anywhere in this file except to open an entry type.
% BibTeX has no comment syntax: a "%" line is merely text between entries, and an
% at-sign starts an entry even there. Spelling out an email address here parsed as
% an entry type and made BibTeX skip every entry after it, so the paper built with
% two citations silently missing from the bibliography -- and the first attempt to
% warn about it in this comment reintroduced the same fault twice over.
%
% There is deliberately no `version`, because the corpus does not have a stable
% one. The site labels itself 測試版 (beta), and it grew while we were using it:
% the Ministry's own April 2026 description says 132 films across 16 themes,
% where our 2026-08-05 capture holds 407 films across 17 themes, 5,283 sentences
% and 23,699 sign tokens (hand_tier=1). The access date is therefore doing the
% work a version number would, and \S2's counts are ours, not the site's.
%
% 8/20, from review: the entry named the principal investigator and the hosting
% institute. On a TSL paper under double-blind review that is close to
% de-anonymizing, and the URL identifies the corpus without it, so the names are
% out. Restore them for camera-ready if the venue's citation practice wants them.
%
% STILL UNRESOLVED -- terms of use. The site has /copyright and /apply pages but
% both are client-rendered and its JSON API exposes no page text, so the terms
% could not be read programmatically and are not quoted here. Content belongs to
% 文化部. Clear reuse terms with them before redistributing the corpus or
% publishing any frame from the films; nothing in this paper reproduces one.
